{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026srChjwIVIb1794372619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>廉署2023年搗破圍標集團，落案起訴23人，分拆為5宗案審理，其中一宗在區域法院開審。</p><p></p><p>案件涉及觀塘興達大廈，2,000萬元大維修工程，本案5名被告包括三名中間人，被控串謀向法團主席及其他成員提供約200萬元賄款，以取得大維修工程及物業管理合約。有關賄款相等於維修工程合約金額的一成及一筆未指明金額的款項。</p><p></p><p>涉案的圍標集團亦涉及大埔新興花園、愉景灣及北角健威花園等維修工程，合約總值逾5億元，賄款逾650萬元。</p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.542362+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:14.943297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:42.306355+00:00","content_hash":"01b1fb7d7dcc8f917021a348b6a24d64fb1869f7788be6617fc208c1507185d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.542362+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}